35	OpenVLA & 7B & 3-layer MLP & 256 & 0.215 & Indep.\ & Closed-loop \\
36	SmolVLA & 450M & Pixel-shuffle $4{\times}4$ & 128 & 0.314 & Entangling & Closed-loop \\
37	\midrule
38	$\pi_{0}$ & 3.3B & Linear & 256 & 0.038 & Indep.\ & Offline \\
